! ------------ AirfoilInfo v1.01.x Input File ---------------------------------- 
! SD 7062 airfoil for OC7 Phase III WP 3.2. 
! No 3D rotational augmentation. Same airfoil from 0.090 m to 0.465 m in the blade axis. 
